hadiths[50]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1670","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney wafad abdul-Qais sey farmaya : ''main tum logon ko hukm deta hun ke maale-ghanimat sey khums (yani paanchwan hissey) ada karo, Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : is hadees main eik qissa hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1671","hum log eik safar mein Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key sath they, jald baaz log aagey badhey aur ghanimat sey) khaney pakaaney ki cheezen) jaldi liya aur (taqseem sey pehley usey) pakaaney lagey, Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam un sey peechey aaney waley logon key sath they, aap haandiyon key qarib sey guzrey to aap ney hukm diya aur wo ulat di gaeen, phir aap ney unkey darmiyan maale-ghanimat taqseem kya, aap ney eik oont ko das bakriyon key barabar qarar diya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Sufiyan Sory ney ye hadees b-tareeq : (عن أبيه سعيد ، an عباية ، an جده رافع بن خديج) riwayat ki hai, is sanad mein abaaya ney apney baap key wastey ka nahin zikr kya hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- hum sey is hadees ko Mehmood bin Ghelaan ney bayan kya wo kehtey hain : hum sey Wakee ney bayan kya, aur Wakee Sufiyan sey riwayat kartey hain. ye riwayat ziyada sahih hai, abaaya bin Rifaa ka samaa, unkey dada Raafey bin khadij sey Sabit hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Solba bin Hakam , Anas , abu-Rehana, Abu-Darda , Abdur-Rehman bin Samra, Zaid bin Khalid, Jabir, Abu-Hurera aur abu-Ayyub (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"1672","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jo loot-paat machaey wo hum mein sey nahin hai''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Anas ki riwayat sey Hasan sahih gharib hai."
"1673","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' Yahud o Nasara ko salam karney mein pehal na karo aur un mein sey jab kisi sey tumhara aamna samna ho jaey to usey tang raastey ki janib janey par majbur kar do '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein ibne-Umar , Anas (Raziallauh anhum) aur abu Basra ghifaari (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain, padhi. - aur hadees ka mafhoom ye hai ke tum khud un sey salam na karo) balke unkey salam karney par sirf jawab do ( , 4- baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain : ye isliye napasand hai ke pehley salam karney sey un ki tazeem hogi jabke musalmanon ko unhen zaleel karney ka hukm diya gaya hai, isi tarah raastey mein aamna samna ho janey par unkey liye raasta na chhodey kyonkey is sey bhi unki tazeem hogi (jo sahih nahin hai) ."
"1674","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''yahud mein sey koi jab tum logon ko salam karta hai to wo kehta hai : « السام عليک » ( yani tum par maut ho ( , isliye tum jawab mein sirf «"
"1675","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney qabila Khas-am ki taraf eik sariya rawana kya, ( kafiron key darmiyan rehney waley musalmanon mein sey) kuch logon ney sajdey key zariey panah chahi , phir bhi unhen qatl karney mein jaldi ki gaee , Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko iski khabar mili to aap ney in ko aadhi diyat deney ka hukm diya aur farmaya : ''main har us musalman sey bariuzzimma hun jo mushrikon key darmiyan rehta hai'', logon ney puchha : Allah key Rasool! aakhir kyon? aap ney farmaya : '' (musalman ko kafiron sey itni doori par rehna chahiye ke) wo dono eik doosrey ( key khana pakaaney ( ki aag na dekh saken '' padhi. ."
"1676","abda ney ye hadees b-tareeq : « Ismael bin abi Khalid an Qais ibne-Abi an Nabi sallallahu Alehi wasallam » ( mursalan ( abu-Muaawia key misl hadees riwayat ki hai, is mein unhon ( abda ( ney Jareer key wastey ka zikr nahin kya . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye riwayat ziyada sahih hai, 2- Ismail bin abi Khalid key aksar shagrid Ismail key wastey sey Qais bin abi Hazim sey) mursalan ( riwayat kartey hain ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney eik sariya rawana kya, un logon ney is mein Jareer key wastey ka zikr nahin kya, aur Hammad bin Salma ney b-tareeq : (إسمعيل بن أبي خالد an قيس ابن أبي an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم) ( marfooan ( abu-Muaawia key misl uski riwayat ki hai, 3- mainey Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari ko kehtey suna : sahih ye hai ke Qais ki hadees Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey mursal hai, neez Samra bin Jundub ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai, aap ney farmaya : '' mushrikon key sath na raho aur na unki hum nasheeni ikhtiyar karo, jo unkey sath rahega ya unki ham-nasheeni ikhtiyar kerega wo bhi unhi mein sey maana jaeyga, padhi. 2- is bab mein Samra sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"1677","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''agar mein zinda raha to inshaAllah jazeera Arab sey Yahud o Nasara ko nikal bahar kar dunga''"
"1678","unhoney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey suna : ''main jazeera Arab sey Yahud o Nasara ko zarur nikaalunga aur is mein sirf musalman ko baqi rakhunga''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1679","Fatima (Raziallahu Anha) ney abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) key paas aa kar kaha : aap ki wafat key baad aap ka waris kon hoga ? unhoney kaha : merey ghar waley aur meri aulad , Fatima (Raziallahu Anha) ney kaha : phir kya wajeh hai ke main apney baap ki waris na banun? abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey suna hai ke '' hum ( anbiya (ka koi waris nahin hota '' ( phir abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha ( lekin Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam jiski kafalat kartey they hum bhi uski kafalat kerengey aur aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam jis par kharch kartey they hum bhi is par kharch kerengey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees is sanad sey Hasan gharib hai, 2- isey Hammad bin Salma aur abdul-wahaab bin Ata ney musnadan riwayat kya hai ye dono aur Muhammad bin umr sey aur Muhammad abu-Salma sey , aur abu-Salma Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat kartey hain, mainey Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari sey is hadees key barey mein puchha to unhon kaha : main Hammad bin Salma key ilawa kisi ko nahin janta hun jisney is hadees ko Muhammad bin Amr sey Muhammad ney abu-Salma sey aur abu-Salma ney Abu-Hurera sey) marfooan ( riwayat ki ho. ( Tirmizi kehtey hain : haan ( abdul-wahaab bin Ata ney bhi Muhammad bin Amr sey aur Muhammad ney abu-Salma sey aur abu-Salma ney Abu-Hurera sey Hammad bin Salma ki riwayat ki tarah riwayat ki hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein umr , Talha , Zuber , Abdur-Rehman bin Auf , Saad aur Aaisha (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"1680","Fatima (Raziallahu Anha) abu-Bakar aur umr Raziallahu anhuma key paas Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki meeras sey apna hissey talab karney ayen , un dono ney kaha : hamney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey suna hai : '' mera koi waris nahin hoga '' , Fatima (Raziallahu anhu) bolin : Allah ki qism ! main tum dono sey kabhi baat nahin karun gi , chunanche wo intiqal kar gaeen , lekin un dono sey baat nahin ki. Raavi Ali bin Esa kehtey hain : « la أكلمكما » ka mafhoom ye hai ke main us meeras key silsiley mein kabhi bhi aap dono sey baat nahin karungi, aap dono sachey hain. (Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain ( ye hadees kaee sanadon sey abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) key wastey sey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey marvi hai."
"1681","mein umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) key paas gaya, usi doran unkey paas Usman bin Affaan , Zuber bin Awam , Abdur-Rehman bin Auf aur Saad bin abi Waqas (Raziallauh anhum) bhi pahunchey , phir Ali aur Abbas Raziallahu anhuma jhagadtey huye aaye , umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney un sey kaha : main tum logon ko us Allah ki qism deta hun jiskey hukm sey aasman o zamin qaaim hai, tum log jantey ho Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya hai : '' hamara ( yani anbiya ka ( koi waris nahin hota , jo kuch hum chhodtey hain wo sadqa hota hai'' , logon ney kaha : haan ! umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : jab Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam wafat paa gaey, abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : main Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ka janashin hun, phir tum apney bhatijey ki meeras mein sey apna hissa talab karney aur ye apni biwi key baap ki meeras talab karney key liye abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) key paas aaye , abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : beshak Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' hamara ( yani anbiya ka ( koi waris nahin hota , hum jo kuch chhodtey hain wo sadqa hota hai'' , ( umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha ( Allah khub janta hai abu-Bakar sachey , nek , bhaley aur haq ki perwi karney waley they . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : is hadees mein tafsil hai, ye hadees Malik bin Aus padhi. ki riwayat sey Hasan sahih gharib hai."
"1682","Fateh Makka key din mainey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey suna : '' Makka mein aaj key baad qiyamat tak ( kafiron sey) jihad nahin kya jaeyga '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. yani Zakariya bin abi zyada ki hadees jo Shaaby key wastey sey aai hai, 2- hum is hadees ko sirf un hi ki riwayat sey jantey hain, 3- is bab mein ibne-Abbas , Suleman (Alaihissalam) bin Sarad aur mutee (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"1683","mainey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key sath jihad kya, jab Fajr tulu hoti to aap ( qitaal sey) thehar jatey yahan tak ke suraj nikal jata, jab suraj nikal jata to aap jihad mein lag jatey , phir jab dophare hoti aap ruk jatey yahan tak ke suraj dhal jata, jab suraj dhal jata to aap Asr tak jihad kartey , phir thehar jatey yahan tak ke Asr padh letey , phir jihad ( shuru ( kartey . kaha jata tha ke us waqt nusrate-Ilaahi ki hawa chalti hai aur momin apney mujahidon key liye namaz mein duayen kartey hain. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : Noman bin Muqrin (Raziallahu anhu) sey ye hadees dusri sanad sey bhi aai hai jo mosul hai, Qatada ki mulaqat Noman sey nahin hai, Noman bin Muqrin ki wafat umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) key daure-khilaafat mein hui."
"1684","bin Khattab ney Noman bin Muqrin (Raziallahu anhu) ko hurmuz unkey paas bheja , phir unhoney mukammal hadees bayan ki, Noman bin Muqrin (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : main Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key sath ( kisi ghazwey mein) hazir huwa , jab aap din key shuru hissey mein nahin ladtey to intizar kartey yahan tak ke suraj dhal jata, hawa chalney lagti aur nusrate-Ilaahi ka nuzool hota . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1685","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''bad-faali shirk hai''. (ibne-Masood kehtey hain) hum mein sey koi aisa nahin hai jis key dil mein uska weham o khayal na paida ho, lekin Allah Taala us weham o khayal ko tawakkul ki wajeh sey zaayel kar deta hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, hum isey sirf Salma bin kuheil ki riwayat sey jantey hain, 2- Shoba ney bhi Salma sey is hadees ki riwayat ki hai, Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 3- mainey Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari ko kehtey suna : Suleman (Alaihissalam) bin Harab is hadees mein (وما منا ولكن الله يذهبه بالتوكل) ki baabat kehtey they ke (وما"
"1686","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' eik ki bimari doosrey ko lag janey aur bad-faali o badshiguni ki koi haqiqat nahin hai padhi. aur mujh ko faal nek pasand hai'' , logon ney puchha : Allah key Rasool ! faale-nek kya chiz hai? aap ney farmaya : ''achi baat''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1687","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko ye sunna achcha lagta tha ke jab kisi zarurat sey niklen to koi ya Rashid ya nNjeeh kahey padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1688","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam jab kisi lashkar par ameer muqarrar kartey to usey khas apney nafs key barey mein Allah sey darney aur jo musalman unkey sath hotey unkey sath bhalai karney ki wasiyat kartey they, uskey baad aap farmatey : Allah key naam sey aur uskey raastey mein jihad karo, un logon sey jo Allah ka inkar karney waley hain, maale-ghanimat mein khayanat na karo, ehad na todo , musla na karo, bachon ko qatl na karo aur jab tum apney mushrik dushmanon key samney jaao to in ko teen mein sey kisi eik baat ki dawat do un mein sey jisey wo maan lein qubul kar lo aur unkey sath ladaai sey baaz raho : in ko Islam laney aur apney watan sey muhajrin key watan ki taraf hijrat karney ki dawat do, aur in ko bata do ke agar unhoney aisa kar liya to unkey liye wohi huquq hain jo muhajrin key liye hain aur unkey ooper wohi zimmedariyan hain jo muhajrin par hain, aur agar wo hijrat karney sey inkar karen to unko bata do ke wo badwi musalmanon ki tarah hongey, unkey ooper wohi ehkam jari hongey jo badwi musalmanon par jari hotey hain : maale-ghanimat aur Fai mein unka koi hissa nahin hai magar ye ke wo musalmanon key sath mil kar jihad keren, phir agar wo aisa karney sey inkar karen to un par Fateh yaab honey key liye Allah sey madad talab karo aur unsey jihad shuru kar do, jab tum kisi qiley ka muhaasra karo aur wo chahen ke tum in ko Allah aur uskey Nabi ki panah do to tum unko Allah aur uskey Nabi ki panah na do, balke tum apni aur apney sathiyon ki panah do, (uskey khilaf na karna) isliye ke agar tum apna aur apney sathiyon ka ehad todtey ho to ye ziyada behtar hai us sey ke tum Allah aur uskey Rasool ka ehad todo , aur jab tum kisi qiley ka muhaasra karo aur wo chahen ke tum in ko Allah key faisley par utaaro to unko Allah key faisley par mat utaaro balke apney faisley par utaaro, isliye ke tum nahin jantey ke unkey silsiley mein Allah key faisley par pahunch sakogey ya nahin'', aap ney isi tarah kuch aur bhi farmaya padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Barida ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Noman bin Muqrin (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"1689","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam namaz Fajr key waqt hi hamla kartey they, agar aap Azan sun letey to ruk jatey warna hamla kar detey , eik din aap ney kaan lagaya to eik aadmi ko kehtey suna : (الله أكبر الله أكبر) aap ney farmaya : ''fitrat ( Deen Islam ( par hai, jab us ney (أشهد أن لا إله إلا الله) kaha, to aap ney farmaya : ''tu jahannam sey nikal gaya''. Hasan kehtey hain : hum sey abul-Waleed ney bayan kya, wo kehtey hain : hum sey Hammad bin Salma ney isi sanad sey usi key misl bayan kya . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1690","Hazrat Ibn Ka'b ibn Malik (raziyallahu 'anhuma) apne walid se riwayat farmate hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Beshah shaheedon ki roohain sabz parindon mein hain jo Jannat ke phalon ya Jannat ke darakhton se khaate hain.\""\n\nAbu 'Isa (Imam Tirmidhi) ne farmaya: Yeh hadith hasan sahih hai."""""
"1691","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah un se) se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Jannat mein pehle teen afraad mujhe pesh kiye gaye: ek shaheed"","" ek paak-daman shakhs jo apni iffat-o-hifazat mein laga rehne wala hai"","" aur ek ghulam jo Allah ki ibadat mein behtreen tha aur apne maalikon ke saachha aur wafaadaar tha.\""\n\nAbu Isa (Tirmizi) ne kaha: \""Yeh ek hadith-e-hasan hai.\"""""""
"1692","Hazrat Anas (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ki talwar ki muthi (hilt) chandi (silver) se bani thi.\"" [Abu Eisa (رحمت الله علیہ) ne farmaya:] Ye hadith Hasan Gharib hai. Isi tarah se Hamam se"","" Qatadah se"","" aur Anas (رضي الله"""""
"1693","Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\nQutaybah ne hamse riwayat ki, Ibn Luḥayʿah ne hamse riwayat ki, ʿAṭāʾ ibn Dīnār se, Abū Yazīd al-Khawlānī se, unhone kaha: Maine Ḍaʿālah ibn ʿUbayd ko suna, unhone kaha: Maine ʿUmar ibn al-Khaṭṭāb (raziyallāhu ʿanhu) ko suna, unhone kaha: Maine Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ko farmāyā:\n\n\Shuhādah (martyrs) chāre qism ke hain:\n\nPehlā: Aisa ādmī jiske īmān mein salāmatī ho"","" jo dushman se mila aur Allāh ke sāmne sachchā rahā yahāṅ tak ki wah qatl ho gayā. Woh wāqaʿī woh shakhs hai jis taraf log Qiyāmat ke din apnī nazar uṭhā kar dekheṅge.\"" Aur Nabī (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne apnā sar uṭhā yahāṅ tak ki un kī topī (qalansuwah) gir gaī. ʿUmar (raziyallāhu ʿanhu) ne kaha: \""Mujhe yaqīn nahi ki unhone ʿUmar kī topī kī nisbat farmāyī yā Nabī (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) kī topī kī.\""\n\nDūsrā: Aisa ādmī jiske īmān mein salāmatī ho"","" jo dushman se mila"","" aur us kī jild par aisā lagā goyā us ke ghabrāne se jaisā talḥ ke kāṅṭoṅ kā lagtā hālāṅki woh bīmārī se marne wālā thā. Phir ek bechārā tīr ā gayā aur use qatal kar diyā. Woh dūsre darje mein hogā.\n\nTīsrā: Aisa ādmī jiske īmān mein salāmatī ho"","" jis ne nekīyāṅ gunāhoṅ ke sāth milā dīṅ. Woh dushman se mila aur Allāh ke sāmne sachchā rahā yahāṅ tak ki wah qatl ho gayā. Woh tīsre darje mein hogā.\n\nChauthā: Aisa ādmī jiske īmān mein salāmatī ho"","" jo apne āp par zulm kartā rahā (yāni gunāh kartā rahā). Woh dushman se mila aur Allāh ke sāmne sachchā rahā yahāṅ tak ki wah qatl ho gayā. Woh chauthe darje mein hogā.\""\n\nAbū ʿĪsā (Tirmidhī) ne kaha: \""Yeh ḥasan gharīb hadith hai. Ham ise sirf ʿAṭāʾ ibn Dīnār kī riwāyat se jānte hain.\""\n\nUnhone kaha: \""Maine Muḥammad (yaʿnī al-Bukhārī) ko farmāyā sunā: 'Saʿīd ibn Abī Ayyūb ne yeh hadith ʿAṭāʾ ibn Dīnār se riwayat kī"","" aur unhone Khawlān ke buzurg shuyūkh se bayān kī"","" aur is mein Abū Yazīd kī riwāyat zikr nahīṅ kī.' Aur ʿAṭāʾ ibn Dīnār ko mu'tabar (reliable) jānā jātā thā (laysa bihi baʾs).\""\n\n\n\n*Ṣalawāt-o-barakāt Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam)"","" unke āl-o-aṣḥāb par.*"""""
"1694","Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) Makkah (فتح مکہ) ke saal mein dakhil hue."
"1695","Urwah Al-Bariqi (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Qayamat ke din tak ghodon ke jadon mein bhalai rahegi: (Woh) sawaab aur ghaneemat (laate hain).\"" [Abu Eisa (رحمه الله) ne kaha:] Is mazmoon par Ibn Umar (رضي الله"""""
"1696","Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Ghode ki barkat uski surkh (laal rang) mein hai.\"" [Abu Eisa (رحمه"""""
"1697","Abu Qatadah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \n\bhtryn ghwra wh hay jw kala hw awr as kay chhray pr nqth (dagh) hw۔\"""""""
"1698","Aik aur silsila (chain) bhi isi ma'ani (meaning) par hai. [Abu 'Eisa ne farmaya:] Ye Hadith Hasan Gharib Sahih hai."
"1699","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne ghodon mein Shikal (ek paer ka seedha aur doosre ka tedha hona) ko napasand kiya. [Abu Eisa (رحمه الله) ne kaha:] Ye Hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Shu'bah (رحمه الله) ne Abdullah bin Yazid Al-Khath'ami (رحمه"
"1700","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne ghodon mein Mudammar (lamba daud karne wale) ke liye Al-Hafiya' se Thaniyyah Al-Wada' tak ka daud ka muqama muqarrar farmaya."
"1701","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Koi bhi shikaar ka sauda (stake) jaiz nahi siwaaye tir-andazi (archery) ke.\"""""""
"1702","mainey Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey suna : ''mujhey apney zaeefon aur kamzoron mein talash karo, isliye ke tum apney zaeefon aur kamzoron ki (duaaon ki barkat ki) wajeh sey rizq diye jatey ho aur tumhari madad ki jati hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1703","Abu Darda (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya ke unhone Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) se suna ke Aap (ﷺ) farmaya: \Mere liye apne kamzoron ko dhundho. Beshak tumhara rizq aur madad sirf tumhare kamzoron ke sabab se hai.\"" [Abu Isa (رحمة الله"""""
"1704","Abu Hurairah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \frshtay as jmaat kay sath nhyn jatay js myn kwyy kta ya ghnty hw۔\"" [abw aysyٰ nay kha:] as mwzwa pr abn amr (rz all anhma) say bhy rwayat mwjwd hyn۔"""""
"1705","Hadith ka Tarjuma-e-Ilmi (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\nQutaybah ne hamain sunaya, 'Abd al-'Aziz ibn Muhammad ne hamain sunaya, Suhayl ibn Abi Salih se, uske baap se, Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah un se) se, unhone kaha:\n\nRasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n*\Koi shaks Allah ki raah mein zakhmi na ho — aur Allah hi behtar jaanta hai ki uski raah mein kaun zakhmi hota hai — magar woh Qayamat ke din khoon ki rang aur mushboo ki khushboo le kar aayega.\""*\n\nAbu 'Isa (Tirmizi) ne farmaya: *\""Yeh ek hasan sahih hadith hai"","" aur yeh Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah un se) se Rasool (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zariye ahadis-e-mutawatir se rawaiyat ki gayi hai.\""*\n\n\n\nTafheemat (Notes):\n\n- يُكْلَمُ (Yuklamu) — is lafz ka asl كَلْمَة se hai"","" jiska matlab zakhm ya chot hai"","" yani jo shaks Allah ki raah mein maidan-e-jang mein zakhmi ho.\n- اللَّوْنُ لَوْنُ الدَّمِ (Al-Lawn Lawn ad-Dam) — rang khoon ki rang hogi"","" jo qurbani ka nishan hai.\n- الرِّيحُ رِيحُ الْمِسْكِ (Ar-Reeh Reeh al-Misk) — khushboo mushboo ki hogi"","" jo shaheed ya zakhmi mujahid ki izzat aur Allah ki taraf se inam hai.\n- وَاللَّهُ أَعْلَمُ بِمَنْ يُكْلَمُ فِي"""""
"1706","Umm Al-Husain Al-Ahmasiyyah (rzy allh anha) rawy krty hyn kh myn nay rswl allh (ﷺ) kw hjh alwdaa kay mwqa pr khtbh arshad frmatay hwyay sna:"
"1707","Hazrat Ibn Umar (rzy allh anhma) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \hr mslman mrkay lyay snna w ataat wajb hay – chahay wh asay psnd kray ya napsnd kray – bshrtykh asay masyt ka hkm nh dya jayay۔ agr asay masyt ka hkm dya jayay tw phr snna w ataat wajb nhyn۔\"""""""
"1708","Abu Yahya ne riwayat ki: Mujahid se, Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se, unhone farmaya: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne janwaron ke darmiyan ladaai karne se mana farmaya.\"""""""
"1709","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) rivayti hai ki: \Nabi (ﷺ) ne chehre ko daag dene aur chehre maarne se manaa farmaya.\"" [Abu 'Eisa (رحمه"""""
"1710","Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne hamaare saamne rivaayat ki, Mu'adh ibn Hisham ne hamaare saamne rivaayat ki, mere baap ne mujh se rivaayat ki, Qatadah se, Anas ibn Malik (radhiAllahu anho) ne rivaarat ki ke RasoolAllah (sallAllahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Jannat ke ahl mein se koi aisa nahi jo duniya ko lautne par raazi ho"","" magaar shaheed ke siwa"","" kyunke woh duniya lautna chahta hai aur kehta hai ke 'Main Allah ki raah mein dus baar qurbaan ho jaoon"",""' is liye ke usay woh izzat nazar aa rahi hai jo Allah ne usay ata farmaayi hai.\""\n\nAbu Isa (al-Tirmidhi) ne farmaya: Ye hadith sahih hai."""""
"1711","Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne hamen hikayat kiya, Muhammad ibn Ja'far ne hamen hikayat kiya, Shu'bah ne Qatadah se riwayat kiya, Qatadah ne Anas رضي الله عنه se, Anas رضي الله عنه ne Nabi ﺻَﻠَّﻰ ﺍﻟﻠَّﻪُ ﻋَﻠَﻴْﻪِ ﻭَﺳَﻠَّﻢ se, in ma'ni ka ek hadith bayan ki. Abu 'Isa (al-Tirmidhi) ne kaha: yeh hasan sahih hadith hai."
"1712","Abu Ubaidah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh Abdullah (rz all anh) nay frmaya: \ywm bdr jb qydywn kw jma kya gya"""""
"1713","Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke mushrikon ne ek mushrik shakhs ki laash khareedna chaha, lekin Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne un se is par muamala karne se inkaar kar diya. [Abu Eisa (رحمه"
"1714","Hadees ka tarjuma (scholarly Roman Urdu mein):\n\nIbn Umar (Razi Allah unhu) se rivayat hai ke: \n*\Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek ghazwa (lashkar) mein humein bheja.\""*\n\n\n\nTafseel aur Sharait:\n- Ghazwa: Iska matlab hai woh jung jismein Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) khud shareek hon. \n- Lashkar: Iska matlab hai ek fauji dasta ya qafila. \n- Rivayat: Is hadees ka mazhab hai ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne apne sahaba ko ghazwa mein bheja"","" jismein Ibn Umar (Razi Allah unhu) bhi the.\n\n\n\nAham Nikaal:\n- Is hadees se pata chalta hai ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne apne sahaba ko ghazwa mein bheja"","" jismein Ibn Umar (Razi Allah unhu) bhi the. \n- Is hadees se pata chalta hai ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne apne sahaba ko ghazwa mein bheja"","" jismein Ibn Umar (Razi Allah unhu) bhi the. \n- Is hadees se pata chalta hai ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne apne sahaba ko ghazwa mein bheja"","" jismein Ibn Umar (Razi Allah unhu) bhi the.\n\n\n\nAakhri Nikaal:\nIs hadees se pata chalta hai ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne apne sahaba ko ghazwa mein bheja"","" jismein Ibn Umar (Razi Allah unhu) bhi the."""""
"1715","Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\nAbu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay:\n\naap nay frmaya: rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya:\n\n\jw shkhs allh say bghyr jhad kay ksy nshan kay mlay ga، tw wh allh say ayk nqs (slh) lyay hwyay mlay ga\""\n\n\n\nabw aysyٰ (trmzy) nay frmaya: yh ayk *ghryb* (nadr/mnfrd) hdys hay jw wlyd bn mslm ky asmaayl bn rafa say rwayt hay۔ awr asmaayl bn rafa kw baz mhdsyn nay *zayf* (kmzwr) qrar dya hay\n\nanhwn nay mzyd frmaya: \""myn nay mhmd (yany amam bkhary) kw frmatay sna: wh ayk sqh (matbr) rawy hyn، jn ky hdys *mqarb alhdys* (drst mayar ky) hay\""\n\nyh hdys abw hryrh (rzy allh anh) kay zryaay nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) say dwsry sndwn say bhy mrwy hay\n\nras slman (rzy allh anh) ky hdys ky snd mtsl (jry hwyy) nhyn hay، kywnkh mhmd bn almnkdr nay kbhy slman farsy (rzy allh anh) say mlaqat nhyn ky thy\n\nasy many kw aywb bn mwsyٰ → mkhwl → shrahbyl bn alsmt → slman (rzy allh anh) → nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) ky snd say bhy mlta jlta rwayt kay sath mrwy hay\n\n\n\n*nwt: yh hdys amam trmzy nay apny snn myn drj ky hay awr asay asmaayl bn rafa ky snd myn zaf ky wjh say* ghryb *qrar dya gya hay، tahm dwsry sndyn as kay many ky tsdyq krty hyn۔*"""""
"1716","Sa'ib bin Yazid (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: \jb rswl allh ﷺ tbw say waps tshryf layay...\"""""""
"1717","Muhammad ibn Bashshar, Ahmad ibn Nasr al-Naysaburi aur doosron ne hum se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Safwan ibn 'Isa ne hum se riwayat ki: Muhammad ibn 'Ajlan ne riwayat ki, al-Qa'qa' ibn Hakim se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurayrah (radhiAllahu anhu) se, unhone kaha: RasoolAllah (sallAllahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Shaheed ko maut ka koi dard nahi hota"","" siwaay iske jis tarah tum mein se kisi ko machchar ka kaatne ka dard hota hai.\"" Abu 'Isa ne kaha: Yeh hasan sahih gharib hadith hai."""""
"1718","Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki: Yazid ibn Harun ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki: al-Walid ibn Jamil al-Filastini ne khabar di, al-Qasim Abu 'Abd al-Raman se, Abu Umamah se, Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, jinhon ne farmaya: \Allah Ta'ala ke nazdeek do qatray aur do nishan se zyada koi cheez mehboob nahi: ek qatra Allah ki darr mein behne wala aansu"","" aur ek qatra Allah ki raah mein behne wala khooh. Aur do nishanon mein se ek nishan Allah ki raah mein chhoda gaya nishan hai"","" aur doosra nishan Allah ki farz ibadat ada karne mein chhoda gaya nishan hai.\"" Abu 'Isa ne kaha: Yeh hadith hasan gharib hai."""""
"1719","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''shaheed ko qatl sey sirf itni hi takleef hoti hai jitni takleef tum mein sey kisi ko chutki leney sey hoti hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai."
